		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18EB86F91CBBCCC6"]
			description: ["One of the two disturbances reported by your trade contacts amongst the Piglins is a colosseum of hot brick.  A pillared structure open to the heat of The Nether Realm and populated by armored elemental beings of flame and soot.  Acquire some scraps of the ancient metal from this hellish realm, a bit of its infused sand and some blaze pwders to make the Eye you need to discover the location of this edifice."]
			id: "43A5B83862D9E94C"
