		{
			dependencies: ["18EB86F91CBBCCC6"]
			description: [
				"You seek to pierce the veil, traveler? To walk where the light of your world dares not tread? Then you must craft the compass that points to nowhere."
				""
				"The Eye of Nothingness. It is not merely a tool; it is a paradox bound in form. To craft it is to hold a mirror to the abyss. As you bind the materials, you will feel the cold vacuum of the space between stars. The Eye does not \"see\" in the way you understand. It yearns. It seeks its home in the silence."
				""
				"Finish your work. Hold the Eye aloft. Do not be alarmed when it pulls at your very essence, guiding you towards the cold, forgotten corners of reality. Follow its gaze, for it leads to the Void Cathedral, a monument to a grief so profound it shattered the boundaries of life and death."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
